To export all products:

```ts
const data = exportProductsStep({
  select: ["id", "title", "handle"],
  batch_size: 100
})
```

To export products from a specific sales channel:

```ts
const data = exportProductsStep({
  select: ["id", "title", "handle"],
  filter: {
    sales_channel_id: "sc_123"
  }
})
```
